      "text": "Bayesian workflow (Gelman, Vehtari & McElreath 2026, Fig. 2.1) in nof1-causal-lab terms",
      "fontSize": 44,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
